    "type": "experiment",
    "title": "Building the PIKART atmospheric river datacube",
    "description": "Builds atmospheric_river_cube.zarr, the xcube-compliant version of the PIKART v1.1 Eulerian Atmospheric River Catalog with harmonised extreme precipitation masks, directly from the original PIK THREDDS source files. The output is a global, 0.5°, 6-hourly datacube spanning 1940–2023 with nine variables: atmospheric-river properties (ar_mask, duration, intensity, rank, ivt) and co-located (extreme) precipitation variables (tp, epe_p90, epe_p95, epe_p99). The build is interruption-safe: re-running resumes from the cube's last successful timestamp.\n",
